  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If an uncommitted transaction exists when the container restarts, it is automatically removed from the ocfl storage after the restart. However, it will remain registered in the DB index tables, where it must be manually removed (rollback via API no longer works - the transaction is not found).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
