    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Ben Pennell",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2092\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2092</a> </p>\n\n<p>The PR rolls back transactions and ocfl sessions during shutdown. During startup it only cleans up transaction database entries, so staging directory files will not get cleaned up in a hard shutdown scenario. My reasoning for this was:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>If OCFL clients other than fedora interacted with the same OCFL root, fedora wouldn't be able to differentiate which staged data belonged to it.</li>\n\t<li>ocfl-java and fcrepo-storage-ocfl do not provide a way to address the staging directory or purge all staging directories without having active sessions, so it felt unsafe to go around its back, and may potentially have not worked in cloud storage environment.</li>\n</ol>\n",
     "created": "18/Sep/24 12:15 PM",
     "id": "23449",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/13859/comment/23449",
     "updateAuthor": {
